--- stdout
Format a Spago workspace or explicit source files.

Usage: iris format [FLAGS]

Flags:
      --write            Replace files with formatted output. This is the default for workspaces.
      --check            Report files that are not formatted without changing them.
      --width <COLUMNS>  Preferred line width. Defaults to 100 columns.
      --indent <SPACES>  Spaces per indentation level. Defaults to 2.
      --unicode          Use Unicode spellings for built-in operators and forall.
      --file <PATH>      Format only this file, without workspace discovery. Repeat for multiple files; use - for stdin.
  -h, --help             Print help
--- stderr
